{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"System is a fundomental part of ECS paradigm."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use systems to implement any behavior or logic that updates entities every frame,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as different types of objects or characters. For example, a physics simulation system calculates and applies the affect of gravity, forces, and collisions for all entities."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A complex game or experience may consist of many systems which need to be executed in a specific order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The dependencies property defines when the update method for each system is called each frame. Update order is defined between system types and not between individual system instances."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like example, let’s create a movement system:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@PlainSystem","struct MovementSystem {","","    \/\/ Configure the query to world.","    \/\/ We want to recieve entities with `PlayerComponent` and `Transform`","    @FilterQuery<Ref<Transform>, With<PlayerComponent>>","    private var query","","    @Res<Input>","    private var input","","    init(world: World) {}","","    func update(context: UpdateContext) {","        self.query.forEach { transform in","            if input.isKeyPressed(.space) {","                \/\/ Add 5 points for vertical direction","                \/\/ if space button pressed","                transform.position.y += 5","            }","        }","    }","}",""]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:6AdaECS6SystemP","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"System","modules":[{"name":"AdaECS"}],"symbolKind":"protocol","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adaecs\/system"]}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/init(world:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/queries","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/systemDependencies","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/systemIdentifier"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/update(context:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/UpdateContext"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/dependencies"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System"},"abstract":[{"text":"An object that affects multiple entities in every frame.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"},{"type":"conformingTypes","t